  "prefLabel": "Dec 103.02 Committee Members",
  "priorExpiration": "2001-03-17",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Dec 103.02 Committee Members.\n\n(a) The committee consists of 8 members as follows:\n\n(1) A resident of the town or city where the nuclear facility is located and appointed by the town or the mayor and council of the city;\n\n(2) The chairman of the public utilities commission;\n\n(3) One senator to be appointed by the senate president;\n\n(4) One member of the house of representatives to be appointed by the speaker of the house;\n\n(5) The state treasurer or designee;\n\n(6) The commissioner of the department of health and human services or designee;\n\n(7) The commissioner of the department of safety or designee; and\n\n(8) The director of the governor’s office of energy and planning or designee.\n\n(b) The committee shall select a chairman to serve for a 3-year term.\n\nSource. #4235, eff 2-20-87, EXPIRED: 2-20-93\n\nNew. #5700, INTERIM, eff 9-17-93, EXPIRED: 1-15-94\n\nNew. #5824, eff 8-30-94, EXPIRED: 8-30-00\n\nNew. #7366, INTERIM, eff 9-18-00, EXPIRED: 3-17-01\n\nNew. #9143, eff 4-25-08",
